Quest Drake Hunt Update
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (QuestDrakeHunt is discovered) Equal to True
        (QuestDrakeHunt is completed) Equal to False
        QuestDrakeHuntCount Less than 6
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Red Drake (Level 10)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Scorching Drake (Level 10)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Red Drake (Level 20)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Scorching Drake (level 20)
    Actions
        Set VariableSet QuestDrakeHuntCount = (QuestDrakeHuntCount + 1)
        Quest - Change the description of QuestDrakeHuntReq1 to (Kill 6 Drakes ( + ((String(QuestDrakeHuntCount)) +  / 6)))
        Quest - Display to (All players) the Quest Update message: |cffffcc00QUEST|r  ...
        Quest - Display to (All players) the Quest Update message: (Kill Drakes  + ((String(QuestDrakeHuntCount)) +  / 6))
        -------- ============ --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
